Source: ttfx
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Maintainer: @MAINTAINER@
Build-Depends:
 debhelper-compat (= 13),
 cargo,
 rustc
Standards-Version: 4.7.4
Homepage: https://github.com/omacom/ttfx
Rules-Requires-Root: no

Package: ttfx
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: terminal text effects
 ttfx animates text in a terminal: it reads text on standard input and draws
 it with one of several dozen effects (rain, fireworks, decryption, beams and
 others). It is a Rust port of TerminalTextEffects by ChrisBuilds, written by
 the Omarchy project, and reproduces that program's rendering frame for frame.
 .
 The @DISTRO_NAME@ desktop's screensaver runs ttfx on the distro's logo in a
 full-screen terminal.
